    "postcodes-io": "https://postcodes.io/docs/licences/"
  },
  "assessment": "Engineering review of factual fields and source terms, not an independent legal certification. Unknown columns/forbidden nested content stop export. Public business/registered-office information may identify individuals; use is limited to location research, with no personal enrichment or marketing. Correction/removal requests use record IDs without publishing private details."
